{"id":"wb-5-459","name":"受禅碑与受禅台","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"受禅碑与受禅台","text":"受禅碑与受禅台位于中国河南省临颍县繁城镇，是东汉最后一任皇帝汉献帝禅让于曹丕，曹魏取代东汉的历史见证，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n受禅碑，曹魏黄初元年（220年）刻立。《公卿将军上尊号》碑，高3.7米，宽1.1米，厚0.33米，是四十六位公卿将军给曹丕的奏章，劝曹丕以魏代汉。《受禅表》碑，高3.7米，宽1.1米，厚0.3米，记录了黄初元年冬十月二十九日汉献帝将皇位禅让给魏王曹丕之事。\n受禅台筑于东汉延康元年，台高13米，面积约8448平方米，台上大殿等建筑早已无存。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%97%E7%A6%85%E7%A2%91%E4%B8%8E%E5%8F%97%E7%A6%85%E5%8F%B0","revisionId":94181548,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94181548","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/613295fff599e0141bd4a4eb.jpg","title":"20240818_Shou_Shan_Tai_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240818_Shou_Shan_Tai_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/20240818_Shou_Shan_Tai_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​受禅碑与受禅台","width":320,"height":213}}